flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Prepare last-transaction query]
    B --> C[Open DB connection]
    C --> D[Bind account number twice]
    D --> E[Execute query]
    E --> F{Transaction found?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Map row into Transaction object]
    G --> H[Return transaction]
    F -- No --> I[Return null]
    C --> J[On SQL error print stack trace]
    J --> I
    H --> K[End]
    I --> K
